		<!-- /MES.Spawn.PlanetaryInstallation.GVK-Test-SpawnGroup-TerrainSkinMedium and ...-TerrainSkinLarge: a real Medium and Large wreck (production behavior and manipulation) with no zone or distance rules; 3 s after spawn the Dust_Armor blocks match the terrain under the wreck -->
		<SpawnGroup>
			<Id>
