		<!-- /MES.Spawn.DroneEncounter.GVK-Test-SpawnGroup-RelationSOBAN and ...-RelationCOALITION: one parked LAV each on an Enemy-only target profile.
		     /MES.BehaviorDebug.TargetEvaluation.true, then /MES.IGLBD.TargetEvaluation: each profile logs the relation it found for every target -->
